<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-136.1-supply-chain-network-strategy-modeling-and-design" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4121" name="W4121. Supply Chain Network Strategy &amp; Design Principles" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy refresh; growth; major cost/service pressure
Frequency: Annual + on strategic change
Volume: Enterprise network (4 DCs, 200 stores, 205+ locations)
Owner: VP Supply Chain / Network Strategy Lead
Participants: COO, Strategy (VS-33), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Finance (VS-17.4), Merchandising (VS-01)
Source: workflow W4121 — Supply Chain Network Strategy &amp; Design Principles</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4121_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4121_Lane1" name="Network Strategy Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4121_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4121_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4121_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4121_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4121_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4121_Start3" name="Strategy refresh; growth; major cost/service pressure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4121_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4121_Task4" name="Network Strategy define the network strategy and design principles…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy define the network strategy and design principles (cost-to-serve, service-level, resilience, scalability to 300+ stores, sustainability), aligned to corporate strategy (VS-33) and the growth plan (10–15 stores/yr links to VS-37)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4121_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4121_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4121_Task5" name="Network Strategy document the current-state network (DCs, cross-dock, DSD…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy document the current-state network (DCs, cross-dock, DSD, store-receiving, lane map), service levels, and cost-to-serve baseline
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4121_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4121_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4121_Task6" name="Network Strategy set design targets and trade-off guardrails (cost vs service…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy set design targets and trade-off guardrails (cost vs service vs working-capital vs capex), and present to the executive team
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4121_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4121_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4121_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4121_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4121_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-638 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Chain Network Strategy, Modeling &amp; Design (PA-136.1).) | - CTL-638: network strategy approved by COO/Board; trade-off guardrails documented
Owner: VP Supply Chain / Network Strategy Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4121_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4121_Annotation8" targetRef="W4121_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4121_Flow10" sourceRef="W4121_Start3" targetRef="W4121_Task4" />
