    <bpmn:process id="W_W4123" name="W4123. DC Footprint, Location &amp; Capacity Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Growth; capacity strain; DC add/close decision
Frequency: Per decision + annual review
Volume: Enterprise DC network (4 DCs; Clark DC4 oversized for growth)
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20)
Participants: DC Ops (VS-04), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Finance/Capex (VS-40), Supply Planning (VS-02)
Source: workflow W4123 — DC Footprint, Location &amp; Capacity Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4123_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4123_Lane1" name="Network Strategy Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4123_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4123_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4123_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4123_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4123_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4123_Start3" name="Growth; capacity strain; DC add/close decision">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4123_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4123_Task4" name="Network Strategy/Real Estate assess DC footprint vs the growth plan (current 4…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy/Real Estate assess DC footprint vs the growth plan (current 4 DCs; Clark oversized for North/Central Luzon expansion), capacity utilization, and the optimal number/location/size of DCs via modeling (W4122)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Real Estate / DC Ops
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4123_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4123_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4123_Task5" name="Network Strategy/Real Estate evaluate add/close/expand/relocate options…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy/Real Estate evaluate add/close/expand/relocate options (cost-to-serve, service, capex links to VS-40, sustainability, risk), and recommend
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance / Real Estate
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4123_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4123_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4123_Task6" name="Network Strategy execute approved changes (DC opening/closure/expand links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy execute approved changes (DC opening/closure/expand links to VS-04/VS-20/VS-97), and track benefit (W4128/W4140)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / DC Ops
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4123_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4123_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4123_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4123_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4123_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-638 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Chain Network Strategy, Modeling &amp; Design (PA-136.1).) | - CTL-638: DC add/close via capex governance (VS-40) and Board approval (VS-36)
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
