    <bpmn:process id="W_W4124" name="W4124. Store Coverage, Territory &amp; Service-Area Assignment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New stores; DC change; service review
Frequency: Per change + annual
Volume: 200 stores across 4 DC service areas
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Supply Planning (VS-02)
Participants: DC Ops (VS-04), Logistics (VS-06), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4124 — Store Coverage, Territory &amp; Service-Area Assignment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4124_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4124_Lane1" name="Network Strategy Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4124_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4124_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4124_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4124_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4124_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4124_Start3" name="New stores; DC change; service review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4124_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4124_Task4" name="Network Strategy assign/optimise store-to-DC coverage (which DC serves which…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy assign/optimise store-to-DC coverage (which DC serves which store), balancing distance/lead time/capacity/load via modeling (W4122)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4124_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4124_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4124_Task5" name="Network Strategy define service areas (replenishment frequency 2–3x/week…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy define service areas (replenishment frequency 2–3x/week, delivery lead time 1–3 days links to VS-02), and handle multi-DC sourcing for constrained supply
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Logistics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4124_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4124_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4124_Task6" name="Network Strategy update coverage on store openings (VS-37)/closures (VS-59)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy update coverage on store openings (VS-37)/closures (VS-59), rebalance on DC change, and monitor service-level adherence (W4139)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4124_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4124_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4124_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4124_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
