      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Network change; routing optimization
Frequency: Per change + continuous optimization
Volume: ~50,000 store-replenishment orders/month (production-calibrated, per data-volumes §1.1); ~42,900 ecommerce orders/month; 200 stores × 2–3 deliveries/week
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Logistics (VS-06)
Participants: Logistics (VS-06), DC Ops (VS-04), Freight (VS-110), last-mile (VS-56)
Source: workflow W4126 — Outbound Distribution Flow &amp; Lane / Routing Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
