      <bpmn:userTask id="W4126_Task4" name="Network Strategy/Logistics design the outbound flow architecture: DC-to-store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy/Logistics design the outbound flow architecture: DC-to-store lanes, multi-stop routing, modal mix (owned 20% / 3PL 80% trucks), and last-mile for ecommerce
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Logistics / Freight
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
