        <bpmn:outgoing>W4126_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4126_Task5" name="Network Strategy/Logistics optimize routes for cost/service (links to VS-06…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy/Logistics optimize routes for cost/service (links to VS-06 W786 route optimization, VS-110 freight), and design consolidation (each store drop consolidates the ~20–30 replenishment orders since the previous drop, 2–3 drops per truck trip, per data-volumes §1.1)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Logistics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4126_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4126_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4126_Task6" name="Network Strategy monitor outbound performance (OTIF, cost-per-stop, fill-rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy monitor outbound performance (OTIF, cost-per-stop, fill-rate W4139), adjust routing, and feed into network model (W4122)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Logistics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4126_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4126_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
