    <bpmn:process id="W_W4127" name="W4127. Network Resilience, Redundancy &amp; Risk-Adjusted Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Risk review; disruption event; resilience program
Frequency: Annual + post-disruption
Volume: Enterprise network resilience
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Risk (VS-21.2)
Participants: Risk (VS-21.2), Supply Planning (VS-02.3), BCP (VS-26), Logistics (VS-06)
Source: workflow W4127 — Network Resilience, Redundancy &amp; Risk-Adjusted Design</bpmn:documentation>
