      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4127_Start3" name="Risk review; disruption event; resilience program">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4127_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4127_Task4" name="Network Strategy/Risk assess network vulnerabilities (single-source SKUs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy/Risk assess network vulnerabilities (single-source SKUs, single-DC-served stores, single-port lanes, typhoon/earthquake exposure, supplier concentration links to VS-02.3 W558)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Risk
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4127_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4127_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4127_Task5" name="Network Strategy design resilience: backup DC sourcing (W4124), supplier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy design resilience: backup DC sourcing (W4124), supplier diversification (links to VS-02.3 W763), multi-port inbound (W4125), buffer/pre-positioning (links to VS-02.3 W1432/W1492), and BCP alignment (VS-26)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4127_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4127_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4127_Task6" name="Network Strategy stress-test the network (simulation W4143), incorporate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy stress-test the network (simulation W4143), incorporate risk-adjustment into design decisions, and report resilience to risk governance (VS-21.2/VS-26)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Risk
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4127_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4127_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4127_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4127_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
