    <bpmn:process id="W_W4128" name="W4128. Network Design Business Case &amp; Investment Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Network change decision
Frequency: Per decision
Volume: Per major network change (DC add/close, lane re-design)
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Finance/Capex (VS-40/VS-17.4), Real Estate (VS-97), COO, PMO (VS-112)
Source: workflow W4128 — Network Design Business Case &amp; Investment Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4128_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4128_Lane1" name="Network Strategy Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4128_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4128_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4128_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4128_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4128_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4128_Start3" name="Network change decision">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4128_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4128_Task4" name="Network Strategy/Finance build the business case (capex, opex, working-capital…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy/Finance build the business case (capex, opex, working-capital, service, risk, sustainability), with TCO and benefit modeling, aligned to VS-133 W4065
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / CFO
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4128_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4128_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4128_Task5" name="Network Strategy/Finance model ROI/NPV/payback, test sensitivity, route via…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy/Finance model ROI/NPV/payback, test sensitivity, route via capex governance (VS-40) and Board approval (VS-36), and sequence with PMO (VS-112) and OCM (VS-134)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Capex / PMO
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4128_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4128_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4128_Task6" name="Network Strategy track realized benefit post-implementation (links to W4140)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy track realized benefit post-implementation (links to W4140), and feed lessons into future network design
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Post-decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4128_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4128_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4128_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4128_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4128_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-638 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Chain Network Strategy, Modeling &amp; Design (PA-136.1).) | - CTL-638: business case approved by Finance/Board; benefit reconciled post-implementation
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
